// Per-Mac build settings that must not be committed. Copied to Local.xcconfig by the build
// scripts if that file is missing; xcodegen wires Local.xcconfig into every target, so a
// regenerate no longer loses what is here. Three settings live here and nowhere else:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// (Xcode → Settings → Accounts → your Apple ID → the team's id; or Signing & Capabilities shows
// it beside the team name.) Leave the line commented on a Mac that only builds for the simulator.
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
//
// A team that is not the owner's cannot register the owner's app group (and may not want the
// owner's bundle id), so it overrides both here. The Share Extension takes `$(T2S_BUNDLE_ID).share`;
// the app reads the group back out of its Info.plist (`T2SAppGroupIdentifier`). The defaults are
// in App/project.yml.
// T2S_BUNDLE_ID = com.t2s.reader
// T2S_APP_GROUP = group.com.t2s.reader
